add(O,cat,'Source positive-sequence impedance','Provide source resistance/reactance when fault level or source-drop modeling requires finite source impedance.','PosSequenceResistance / PosSequenceReactance; native units and voltage base declared','Both reference fields=0; no measured/calculated source impedance established','Grid System Studies / Protection','Optional for current export gate; required only by a selected study/model. Zero is not a fault-level assessment. [MDB]')
add(O,cat,'Source zero-sequence and line-to-ground fault resistance','Provide the source grounding/sequence inputs for a selected unbalanced-fault study.','ZeroSequenceResistance / Reactance; LineToGroundFaultResistance; native units/base','Reference sequence/fault resistance fields=0','Protection / Earthing Studies','Optional study-specific group; not a mandatory extra requirement for every generated MDB. [MDB]')
add(O,cat,'Feeder demand scaling and aggregate demand values','Confirm any feeder-wide scaling or aggregate demand inputs used by the receiving study.','FeederMultiplier; phase demand / PF fields in native model units','Reference FeederMultiplier=1; feeder demand/PF fields=0','Load Research / Network Studies','Optional. Aggregate feeder zero PF is not an acceptable category-rate power factor. [MDB]')
add(O,cat,'Distributed-load ZIP model settings','Confirm distributed-load constant impedance/current percentages if the study uses the source load-model fields.','PercentDistLoadConstImpedance / Current in percent; remaining model basis confirmed','Reference fields: 40 / 10','System Planning / Load Research','Optional model-design confirmation; these fields are not independent mandatory entries in the current form. [MDB]')
add(O,cat,'Spot-load ZIP model settings','Confirm spot-load constant impedance/current percentages if spot loads are selected.','PercentSpotLoadConstImpedance / Current in percent','Reference fields: 40 / 30','System Planning / Load Research','Optional / selected-load-model specific. Do not assume every customer is a spot load. [MDB]')
add(O,cat,'Spot/distributed load mode and load placement','Confirm the load representation and location convention for the selected study.','IsSpotLoad; LocationToModelSpotLoads supported code; CapacityFactor','Reference: IsSpotLoad=0; location=C; CapacityFactor=1','System Planning / Load Research','Optional mapping confirmation. These are available historical conventions, not an approved current demand method. [MDB]')
add(O,cat,'Demand coincidence / diversity study basis','Document any diversity/coincidence assumption included in the approved demand estimation standard.','Written method and factors only if that method calls for them','Not provided as a verified category method in the inputs','Load Research / Commercial','Optional method-specific evidence. No separate universal diversity-factor field is required by this application. [EC]')
add(O,cat,'Load growth model and horizon','Provide growth curves/rates and forecast years if a future-year load study is requested.','PercentLoadGrowthRate / growth-curve references / reviewed study years','Section reference growth rate=2; source historic labels 2015-2025','System Planning / Forecasting','Optional forecast scope. Historical years and rate are not current approvals. [MDB]')
add(O,cat,'Section ampacity override and emergency rating','Supply explicit section/equipment rating overrides only if the selected model uses them rather than the installed library.','UseSectAmpRating flag; AmpRating / emergency ratings in native model units','Section reference: UseSectAmpRating=0; AmpRating=100','Distribution Design / Asset Ratings','Optional override. The disabled 100 value does not establish a real 100 A conductor rating. [MDB]')
add(O,cat,'Neutral grounding and load phase-ground convention','Confirm grounding/load connection fields when implementing the applicable circuit model.','NeutIsGrounded; role-specific LoadConnectionPhaseGnd codes','Reference: NeutIsGrounded=1; supply phase-ground=0, downstream=1','Distribution Design / Earthing / Network Studies','Optional explicit model confirmation, not a new form gate. The two phase-ground values must not be flattened to one global value. [MDB]')
add(O,cat,'Tap-control / LTC operating settings','Provide regulation controls only if the selected transformer/control model uses LTC behavior.','Supported gang/manual flags, per-phase tap/voltage/band settings and tap limits','Reference forward settings=122; band=0.75; limits +6/-4; units/meaning require confirmation','Transformer Engineering / Voltage Control','Optional control-study scope. These historical fields do not prove LTC is installed or active. [MDB]')
add(O,cat,'Transformer network protection state','Confirm network-protector flags if a modeled transformer has that function.','NetProtEnabled / NetProtIsAuto / NetProtIsOpen supported flags','Reference flags: 0 / 0 / 0','Protection / Distribution Operations','Optional equipment-specific scope; not a universal final-export blocker. [MDB]')
add(O,cat,'Meter readings, meter type and calibration settings','Provide meter data only when the study uses a modeled meter for demand, ratings or reliability calibration.','Selected meter fields and native units; supported type/mode codes','Reference meter records contain SectionId only; remaining fields NULL','Metering / Network Studies','Optional measurements. Section attachment becomes conditional if a meter is added; no readings are inferred from NULL. [SM, MDB]')
add(O,cat,'Reliability failure, repair and cost assumptions','Provide approved reliability inputs only if a reliability/economic study is part of the modeled scope.','Failure rates per year; repair times hours; cost currency/basis declared','Reference transformer repair time=6 h; repair cost=5000 in source monetary units','Asset Management / Reliability / Finance','Optional study-specific values. Source zeros/defaults are not verified reliability statistics. [MDB]')
add(O,cat,'Equipment energization and retirement model years','Define year indices when the model uses equipment commissioning/retirement scenarios.','Supported EnergizeYear / RetireYear model indices and study-year schedule','Reference values: 0 and 100','Asset Management / System Planning','Optional. These are model indices, not established physical commissioning/retirement calendar dates. [MDB]')
add(O,cat,'Protection, switching, regulation and capacitor studies','Provide equipment libraries, settings and topology only if these additional devices/studies are requested.','Vendor-supported device records/settings and a separately reviewed supported mapping','Relevant reference tables are empty; current writer does not populate these device tables','Protection / System Planning / Software Team','Optional additional scope. Current v1/v2 writer supports six/nine tables; this may need implementation beyond supplying data. [WR, MDB]')
add(O,cat,'Consolidated multi-transformer feeder export decision','Confirm common-source identities and explicit support if exporting more than one transformer in a single MDB.','consolidated_supported=true only with reviewed consistent source/network mapping','No current-project consolidated feeder design inferred from individual MDBs','Network Studies / GIS / Application Admin','Optional project-specific scope. Full export rejects an unapproved consolidated mapping. [EPB]')
add(O,cat,'Model-specific temperature / rating / earth-return assumptions','Supply additional physical assumptions only where the installed conductor/configuration model requires them.','Native library model parameters and documented bases; no universal numeric defaults','Not established by the reference ID strings or GPX metadata','Distribution Design / Library Custodian','Optional/model-dependent beyond the installed package. Do not turn absent generic parameters into universal application requirements. [MDB]')

